cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Chemtool"
abstract: >-
  A browser workbench for retrieving and comparing chemical and metabolite
  records from public databases. Resolves compounds on PubChem, retrieves
  structural analogs from PubChem's 2D similarity service, reads Human
  Metabolome Database records including pathways and associated enzymes, and
  balances chemical equations. Structural descriptors are recomputed on-device
  from the parsed structure and shown beside the source database's own values.
  Every figure is either retrieved from a named database or produced by a
  documented calculation; the tool predicts no binding affinity, target,
  toxicity or synthetic route.
authors:
